These ground snow survey data were collected to calibrate gamma and passive microwave remote sensing data that were acquired in the BOREAS study areas.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af0\afs20\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe2052\hich\af0\loch\ql\widctlpar\ltrpar\hyphpar0\cf0\f0\fs20\lang1033\dbch\af0\langfe2052{\rtlch\af4 \ltrch\hich\af4\loch\f4\loch
These data were collected during the BOREAS Focused Field Campaign-Winter (FFC-W) in 1994 and cover 10-20 km lengths with measurements representing the snow conditions for 1- to 2-km intervals along those lengths.  This data set should be used in conjunction with the HYD-06 Airborne Gamma Ray Soil Moisture Data since these 2 data sets cover the same sites.  Please consult the documentation for this HYD-06 data set for more information about the transects.}
